      "costUsd": 0.005133499999999999,
      "pronunciationText": "Last video ended here, with a cubic and its two derivative graphs. Now let's put them to work. This laptop shows a new video's total views, day by day. They climb slowly at launch, then fast, then level off. From this graph alone, which day brought the most new views? By the end, you'll read it straight off the shape."
