      "inputTokens": 59,
      "outputTokens": 467,
      "costUsd": 0.0042325,
      "pronunciationText": "That's the whole checklist: domain, symmetry, intercepts, stationary points, concavity and inflections, asymptotes and other breaks, and what happens as x heads off to infinity. For a polynomial, the domain and asymptote checks take one line. The next curve needs all seven."
