      "pronunciationText": "Back to the video. Daily views are the gradient of the total. At launch the total is nearly flat, so daily views start near zero. The total is steepest on day three, so that's the busiest day for new views. After that it still rises, but less steeply, so daily views fall away in a long tail. And day three is where the total switches from concave up to concave down. The busiest day is the inflection."
